\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Ablation and descriptive mechanism evidence. Left: average LER change relative to UKF for the scoped feature ablation table. Right: lower-clip intervention effect across the six-seed mechanism pack. The figure supports feature sensitivity and a cautionary intervention reading; it does not establish a causal mechanism, teacher necessity or a successful mitigation.}}{22}{figure.caption.37}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:ablation-mechanism}{{4}{22}{Ablation and descriptive mechanism evidence. Left: average LER change relative to UKF for the scoped feature ablation table. Right: lower-clip intervention effect across the six-seed mechanism pack. The figure supports feature sensitivity and a cautionary intervention reading; it does not establish a causal mechanism, teacher necessity or a successful mitigation}{figure.caption.37}{}}
