\newlabel{fig:statcalib}{{5}{23}{Supplementary statistical-calibration analysis. The plot compares UKF, hybrid-\(b\) and the statistical-calibration values already listed in Table~\ref {tab:statcalib}. The result supports the broader affine calibration contract, but it must remain separate from the main comparison because it was not generated under the same predeclared ranking protocol; the absolute values should not be interpreted as a matched win over the main hybrid branch}{figure.caption.40}{}}
